      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "An extensive water management system was designed to replenish the area’s water table, featuring 46 miles of freshwater canals and 23 miles of saltwater canals.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
