      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Florida’s first serious wildland–urban interface fire occurred in Palm Coast in 1985, burning 131 homes and prompting statewide evacuation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palm_Coast%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Palm Coast’s parks and trails showcase native Florida beauty, lined with historic oaks, towering pines, and indigenous vegetation.",
